==Miscellaneous==
*Watching ads for [[Cat Food]] can now only be done up to five times per day.
*Added 3 new [[User Rank]] rewards:
**16,100 grants 1 Platinum Shard.
**16,200 grants 5 Catamin As.
**16,300 grants 5 Catamin Bs.
*Added 1 new enemy type: [[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]]
**This type includes [[Baron Seal]], [[Le'Grim]], [[Mega-Mooth]], [[Super Hyppoh]], [[Archangel Exiel]] and [[Big Peng Z]].
*Added 1 new [[Special Abilities|Special Ability]]: [[Colossus Slayer]]
*Added [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] type to filter.
*Added 1 new item used in the Chinese New Year Gacha: Legendary Lucky Charm.
*[[Baozi Cat (Special Cat)|Baozi Cat]]'s + level cap increased to 10.
*Grandon Mining Corps units are now permanently in [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Cat Capsules]].

